@startuml
title Address Validation - Common registry

box "Wholebuyer" #E0E0E0
  participant "Sales" as Sales
  participant "Location Management\n(TMFC014)" as LocationMgt #E5DCF0
end box

== Wholebuyer selects address of interest ==

loop until address selected

    Sales -> LocationMgt : 1 GET /geographicAddress?{address fields}=...
    LocationMgt --> Sales : 2 200 OK

end

== Address Id identified ==

@enduml
